","When a web shell is hosted on an internet facing victim system, an adversary can remotely access the system to perform malicious actions."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1505.003"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Maintain primary access with web shells"],["description","Crowdstrike has observed Deep Panda adopting web shells as their primary access back into a victim organization."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1505.003"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Leave showimg.asp as fallback"],["description","After it is replaced by more robust backdoors, it may be left in place as a last resort should remediation take place."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1505.003"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Write showimg.asp web shell"],["description","In a recent case, we witnessed this web shell written to a standalone file (named showimg.asp), but it could easily be injected into an existing page, making it even stealthier."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1505.003"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Execute VBScript from query string"],["description","The request object will look for chr(42) which is an asterisk (*), returning whatever is passed to it in a HTTP GET or POST. Next, the Execute() function will execute any value returned by the lookup.\n\nEffectively, an attacker can form a request that will execute any VBScript code."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1059.005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Upload or download files"],["description","For example, this code can perform any of the following actions:\n\nFile upload or download"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-ac